<title>UK: Carpetright says H1 pretax profit up 38 pct.</title>
<headline>Carpetright says H1 pretax profit up 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>26 weeks to October 26, 1996</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.1		   vs 8.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.5		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    13.96		  vs 10.12</p>
<p> Turnover		   106.51		 vs 83.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name of the British carpet and floor coverings group is Carpetright Plc.</p>
